for sufficiently large $T\gg1$, as desired.

\label{t4.1}
Let $u$ be the  solution as in Theorem \ref{t2.3}. Suppose $0< \eta_0,\eta_1\ll1$ are two sufficiently small constants to be determined later,  and $J = [a,b]$ is an interval for which
